      "answer": "\\(4x^2 - 7xy + 5y^2\\)",
      "acceptedAnswers": [
        "\\(4x^2 - 7xy + 5y^2\\)"
      ],
      "explanationZhHans": "先计算2B：\\(2B = -2x^2 + 4xy - 4y^2\\)。再算\\(A - 2B = (2x^2 - 3xy + y^2) - (-2x^2 + 4xy - 4y^2) = 2x^2 - 3xy + y^2 + 2x^2 - 4xy + 4y^2 = 4x^2 - 7xy + 5y^2\\)。注意去括号时符号变化。"
